   "kind": "execution refuses a late legitimate change",
   "claim": "A signal 13.1 h after a legitimate 4 x 4 change adopts at most 0.05 of it over no signal once the tissue has executed (commitment at 6 or 12 h, or the cue fading at 12 h), and at least 0.1 with no execution or with execution only at 24 h, on average",
   "rule": "HOLDS if on average over the twelve unit-body pairs at t = 7,918 in change4@3918, dial-c's r_in exceeds never-c's by at most 0.05 for C6, C12 and F12, and by >= 0.1 for SL and C24, else FAILS",
